<title>JAPAN: Japan 10-year JGB auction lowest price 100.30.</title>
<headline>Japan 10-year JGB auction lowest price 100.30.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 2.8 percent 191st 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) auction, covering 60 percent of the one trillion yen issue, were as follows, the Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 100.30   Stop rate     2.761 pct</p>
<p> Average price	100.38   Average yield 2.751 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   1.9841 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	590.6 billion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 10.2949 pct</p>
<p> Issue date   Dec 20, 1996   Maturity   Dec 20, 2006</p>
</text>
